 "texts": [
  "What is poetry?, you ask as you nail in my pupil your blue pupil. What is poetry? You ask me so. Poetry... you are her.",
  "What is poetry? You ask while you look at me with a blue gaze in my pupil. What is poetry? And you ask me? Poetry... you.",
