  "What is poetry, you say while piercing my pupil with your blue pupil. What is poetry? And you ask me? Poetry ... you are.",
  "What is poetry? you ask, as you fix your azure pupil on my brain. What is poetry? And you ask me? Poetry... and you, are you. (If it's not needed, remove it)",
  "What is... poetry? You say... while you lock... your blue pupil... in my pupil. What is poetry? And you ask me. Poetry... you are.",
